                    <img src="/assets/Courses/core java.png" style="height:300px;width:100%" alt="devops" />
                    <br />
                    <h4> Course Information</h4>
                    <p> <i class="bi bi-person-fill" style="color:orange"></i> <b>Batches Available:</b> Weekdays/Weekends</p>
                    <p> <i class="bi-bookmark-heart-fill" style="color:orange"></i> <b>Training Mode:</b> Classroom & Online</p>
                    <p> <i class="bi-bell-fill" style="color:orange"></i> <b>Language:</b> English, Hindi, Marathi</p>
                    <p>

                    </p>
